\fn{C1_identification}: $\sup|\tilde\kappa e|$ was printed ``$=1.7428\cdot10^{-3}$'' (a truncation of $0.00174285$); text v39 prints $\le1.7429\cdot10^{-3}$. The (GS) strict-improvement bounds are printed $5.3903\cdot10^{-4}$, $0.040936$ (outward); the 5-digit truncations $5.3902\cdot10^{-4}$, $0.040935$ that appear in status notes are not upper bounds.
\subsection*{O6. The stale lemmaU\_v34 quote}
No text of the v38 or v39 set prints $0.1475$ (checked by script); \fn{lemmaU_v39.tex} prints $\sqrt2\cdot0.10434\le0.1476$. The stale quote ``$\sqrt2 S_1^v\le0.1475$'' remains only in the superseded \fn{fix1/lemmaU_rev/lemmaU_v34.tex} (unchanged); stage 20 of manifest\_v38 checks the v37 quote $0.1476$ instead (REPIN\_REPORT, ``Stage 20'').
\subsection*{O7. Chart lemma body}
\fn{chart_lemma_body_v39.tex} names the verifier \fn{fin13v4c} and the stage-19 output of manifest\_v38; the printed bounds are unchanged and hold for both the \fn{fin12f4} and the \fn{fin13v4c} computation (number check v39).
